      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A 44-year old women presented with a increasing abdomen and mild pain since several months. In surgery a cystic fibrothecoma of the ovary of 10 kg was removed. Fibrothecoma's are rare benign tumours of the ovaries. These tumours rarely grow this big."},
